{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:45 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"姜濤晒《Superman》跳舞片 動作俐落獲姜糖激讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/438fa40ba87e5293c18138a25e17c84e/2026-10/cats2_12.jpg\"/>\n<p>早前「NBA中國賽2026」系列活動在澳門舉行，除了籃球賽事，不得不提的還有壓軸表演嘉賓是姜濤、韓國歌手EVAN和林書豪加上姜濤的籃球技巧挑戰賽等。當日姜濤獻唱包括《LAVA》、《Superman》及《無人不知的戰果》等歌曲，又唱又跳，炒熱了現場氣氛！</p>\n<img alt=\"今日姜濤在其個人社交平台上分享一段《Superman》的跳舞短片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3459148920c1c2feb82b5b3f16b2a466/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_52_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"片中他和排舞師Winwin跳舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/88f12d848ba5de2fedb98a6e5582033c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_52_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩人好有默契。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/079fcd203d18737f039c9002626d6fa0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_52.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤動作乾淨俐落。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a1e68f85806b7f3708303b0d50618e07/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_53_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"節奏感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7223551963a54f9d8605336305085f69/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_53_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"無論是步伐還是身體律動都相當到位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d8f9d84a36ee5554fa49c0790354c6a9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_53.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"舞姿既有型又有力度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/13ca1123b748fa5d2ca5ab082ffd0bc3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_54_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"睇得出他為這次演出花了不少心機練習。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2f58ffc021a8796fbe7f8081fb0200b8/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_54_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"表現相當吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b2aba5a4c3050d046606f6c0e6a9e131/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_20_40_54.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林書豪和姜濤。(魏國謙攝)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/68a8f0986843b60b3e11f883bbdd8369/2026-10/179241659780664.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤、歐陽靖和林書豪。(魏國謙攝)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f4d0c2a2ee04eaeb1882aec8c894443c/2026-10/179241659786557.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤在技巧大賽中。(魏國謙攝)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dac9a3f91322e7bb86d3bebc90a629a6/2026-10/179241659725050.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤和林書豪在場邊觀賽。(魏國謙攝)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9b2ddbf513ca62672b614b8c250d991a/2026-10/179241659742465.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤開心地參加技巧大賽。(魏國謙攝)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b1985320e756e340e8ff0caf7926815/2026-10/179241659758187.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。(魏國謙攝)\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c103b8c598a8503a2aae46f6e09b3a36/2026-10/179241659723072.jpg\"/>\n<h2>姜濤與排舞師Winwin互相敬禮</h2>\n<p>今日姜濤在其個人社交平台上分享一段《Superman》的跳舞短片。片中他和排舞師Winwin互相敬禮鞠躬握手，便開始跳舞。姜濤動作乾淨俐落、節奏感十足，無論是步伐還是身體律動都相當到位，配合歌曲能量感強，舞姿既有型又有力度，睇得出他為這次演出花了不少心機練習，整體表現相當吸睛。</p>\n<h2>「姜糖」大讚排舞師編舞出色</h2>\n<p>短片貼出後，「姜糖」紛紛讚好和正評，留言說：「兩位都跳得好有型，好好睇」、「Thx Win Win 跳得好型」、「兩位都跳得好有型，好好睇」，不少網民也大讚排舞師的編舞確實不同凡響。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T14:01:04.692528+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":415,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:45:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:58:02.361406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:58:02.361406+00:00","content_hash":"1a83d9402a8c33b32b619b728062bca410368d8a46374a2e75981aa131735eef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}